{"Title":"An Act amending the Cranberry Highway Smart Growth Overlay District","BillNumber":"S2689","DocketNumber":"SD3029","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"MJR0","Name":"Michael J. Rodrigues","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MJR0","ResponseDate":"2024-02-14T12:42:35.647"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"MJR0","Name":"Michael J. Rodrigues","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MJR0","ResponseDate":"2024-02-14T12:42:35.6466667"},{"Id":"WMS1","Name":"William M. Straus","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/WMS1","ResponseDate":"2024-02-14T12:43:55.99"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2689/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Rodrigues, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 2689) of Michael J. Rodrigues and William M. Straus (by vote of the town) for legislation to amend the Cranberry Highway Smart Growth Overlay District.  Consumer Protection and Professional Licensure.  [Local Approval Received.]","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Subsection (b) of section 1 of chapter 25 of the acts of 2023 is hereby amended by striking out the words “Country lane, as those areas are designated on the map entitled “Cranberry Highway Smart Growth Overlay District, Cranberry Highway Rochester, MA” and dated April 8, 2019” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- Country road extension, as those areas are designated on the map entitled “Cranberry Highway Smart Growth Overlay District, Cranberry Highway Rochester, MA” and dated April 8, 2019, as may be amended from time to time.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[{"Description":"Rochester LA -- alcohol license","DownloadUrl":"http://malegislature.gov/api/DownloadReport?attachmentId=17785&title=Rochester%20LA%20--%20alcohol%20license"}],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J17","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J17"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}